(iii) 'verbal and emotional abuse' includes- (a) insults, ridicule, humiliation, name calling and insults or ridicule specially with regard to not having a child or a male child; and (b) repeated threats to cause Shwetank Chadha vs Geetanjali Chadha on 30 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/23263475/
